# MPU6050 滤波器配置选项

menu "MPU6050 Filter Options"
    depends on MPU6050

config MPU6050_FILTER_ENABLED
    bool "Enable MPU6050 Data Filtering"
    default y
    help
      Enable sliding average filtering for MPU6050 sensor data to reduce noise.

config MPU6050_FILTER_WINDOW_SIZE
    int "Sliding Average Filter Window Size"
    range 2 20
    default 5
    depends on MPU6050_FILTER_ENABLED
    help
      Number of samples to average in the sliding window filter.
      Larger values provide more smoothing but increase latency.
      Range is 2-20, default is 5.

endmenu